1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,400
Welcome to the new materials testing lab,
Carlos, Mia. I'm Steve, the lab technician.

2
00:00:05,944 --> 00:00:08,157
Have you got the floor
plan? We've just come in

3
00:00:08,181 --> 00:00:10,312
through the main
entrance, on the south side.

4
00:00:10,565 --> 00:00:11,680
Yes, got it.

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,320
Before anything else, the
safety equipment cupboard.

6
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:18,880
As you come in, it's against
the south wall just to your right.

7
00:00:19,265 --> 00:00:22,080
Goggles, gloves and ear
defenders are kept in there.

8
00:00:22,335 --> 00:00:24,700
And the sink? I need to wash my hands.

9
00:00:25,575 --> 00:00:27,280
That's in the opposite direction.

10
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:30,400
Turn left as you come in
and it's tucked into the corner.

11
00:00:30,845 --> 00:00:32,320
Where will you be during sessions?

12
00:00:33,569 --> 00:00:36,800
In the middle of the room, at the
instructor's desk, facing the door.

13
00:00:37,105 --> 00:00:38,220
And the workbench is?

14
00:00:39,189 --> 00:00:41,080
They're in a row along the back wall.

15
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,884
Workbench one is at the
left-hand end, two is in the middle,

16
00:00:44,908 --> 00:00:47,912
and three is at the right-hand
end, nearest the corner.

17
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,760
What's the tall unit running
down the right-hand wall?

18
00:00:51,764 --> 00:00:54,160
That's the storage
cupboard for spare materials.

19
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,500
It runs most of the length of that wall.

20
00:00:56,849 --> 00:00:57,880
And the fume cupboard?

21
00:00:58,345 --> 00:01:02,300
On the same wall, at the far
end, just below workbench three.

22
00:01:02,725 --> 00:01:05,480
So the fumes are extracted
away from where you're working.

23
00:01:05,894 --> 00:01:08,380
What's that small machine
just to the right of your desk?

24
00:01:08,679 --> 00:01:10,540
That's the tensile testing machine.

25
00:01:10,929 --> 00:01:13,280
You'll be using it more
than anything else this term.

26
00:01:13,634 --> 00:01:15,000
Is there an emergency shower?

27
00:01:15,374 --> 00:01:17,500
Yes, in the corner on
the right as you come

28
00:01:17,524 --> 00:01:19,812
in, at the bottom end
of the storage cupboard.

29
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:23,140
If any chemical gets on
your skin, go straight there.

30
00:01:23,579 --> 00:01:25,700
Right, let's go through
to the equipment store.

31
00:01:26,109 --> 00:01:28,420
The door brings you into
the middle of its west wall.

32
00:01:29,379 --> 00:01:32,446
The calibration workbench is
the one standing on its own in the

33
00:01:32,470 --> 00:01:35,452
centre of the room, where
instruments are checked before use.

34
00:01:35,744 --> 00:01:36,744
And the shelving?

35
00:01:37,389 --> 00:01:41,520
There are three units along the wall on
your left as you come in, the north wall.

36
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:44,080
Microscopes are on
the one nearest the door.

37
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:47,188
Hand tools, spanners,
calipers and so on, in

38
00:01:47,212 --> 00:01:49,832
the middle, and spare
parts at the far end.

39
00:01:50,124 --> 00:01:52,080
Where do we sign equipment in and out?

40
00:01:52,999 --> 00:01:56,740
At the logbook station, on the wall
opposite the door in the upper half.

41
00:01:57,124 --> 00:02:01,160
Below it, on the same wall, is the
charging station for battery-powered tools.

42
00:02:01,504 --> 00:02:02,580
And protective gloves?

43
00:02:03,649 --> 00:02:07,520
The protective glove drawer is on the
south wall, at the end nearest the door.

44
00:02:07,939 --> 00:02:10,900
The waste disposal bin is at
the other end of that same wall.

45
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,280
First aid kit?

46
00:02:12,350 --> 00:02:15,080
Just inside the door, on
your left as you come in.

47
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:16,460
And the fire extinguisher?

48
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,180
Just inside the door
too, but on your right.

49
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,560
Thanks, Steve. That's really clear.

50
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:26,000
Good. I think you're both
ready for your first session.

